title: Organisers for the Districts
subtitle: Congress delegates are chosen in the districts. Where you send organisers, a faction grows.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_district_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_district_timer = 2

= Organisers for the Districts

The Zentrale has money for a few full-time organisers. Each district has its own politics.

- @berlin
- @hamburg
- @saxony
- @ruhr

@berlin
title: Berlin-Brandenburg, the Left's fortress.
subtitle: Strengthens the <span class="f-left">Left</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {left: 5});
Q.readiness += 1;
!}

Berlin's cells are loud, young and impatient. The new organisers mostly end up working for Fischer and Maslow.

@hamburg
title: The Wasserkante around Hamburg.
subtitle: Strengthens <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {stalin: 5});
Q.readiness += 2;
!}

The dockers and shipyard workers of Hamburg are among the most militant in Germany. Ernst Thälmann is one of them, and they know it.

@saxony
title: Saxony, the industrial heartland.
subtitle: Strengthens the <span class="f-right">Right</span>. Improves relations with the <span class="p-spd">SPD</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {right: 5});
Q.spd_relation += 2;
!}

Saxony's Communists work closely with the left-wing <span class="p-spd">SPD</span> of the state. Brandler's people run the district and the organisers join them.

@ruhr
title: The occupied Ruhr, where the members are new and angry.
subtitle: Brings in members. Strengthens the <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.lean(Q, {ultra: 4});
Q.members += 10;
Q.rev_situation += 2;
!}

The occupation and the inflation are bringing thousands of new members into the Ruhr locals. Many of them think the unions and parliament are a waste of time.
